      * RPG III (RPG38 and RPG): operations that differ from RPG II
     H
     FCUSTMAS IF  E           K        DISK
     FORDERS  UF  F      80            DISK
     FLATE    IF  E                    DISK                           UC
     IWORK       IDS
     I                                        1  10 CODE
     I                                    P  11  152RATE
      * SELEC group
     C                     SELEC
     C           CODE      WHEQ 'A'
     C                     EXSR DOA
     C           CODE      WHEQ 'B'
     C           RATE      ANDGT5
     C                     EXSR DOB
     C                     OTHER
     C                     EXSR DOC
     C                     ENDSL
      * IFxx with ANDxx and ORxx
     C           CODE      IFEQ 'X'
     C           RATE      ANDGT1
     C           RATE      OREQ 0
     C                     Z-ADD1         FLAG  10
     C                     ENDIF
      * ANDxx that cannot be converted leaves a safe header
     C           CODE      IFEQ 'Y'
     C   99      RATE      ANDGT1
     C                     Z-ADD2         FLAG
     C                     ENDIF
      * ENDIF closing a DO group is a mismatch
     C                     DO   3         I     20
     C                     ENDIF
     C                     ENDDO
      * Loop control
     C           CNT       DOWLT9
     C           CNT       ADD  1         CNT   30
     C   01                ITER
     C   02                LEAVE
     C                     ENDDO
     C                     LEAVE
      * CLEAR and RESET
     C                     CLEARWORK
     C                     RESETFLAG
      * Reported R
     C           CODE      CABEQ'Z'       SKIP           88
     C           FIRST     CAT  LAST:1    NAME  30
     C                     OPEN LATE
     C                     ENDSL
